    <p><strong>Review note.</strong> Scope and resource roles were reviewed through 4 August 2026. Official Martin, APS, École Polytechnique, and University of Strasbourg destinations were checked; the lecture routes support conceptual study but do not validate a functional, SCF solution, representation, or material result.</p>
  </aside>
</BaseLayout>
